WEBVTT

NOTE
Demo captions. They are not the film's dialogue: they show where captions
appear and which keys the player answers to.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Captions appear here, over the picture.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Press C to turn them off and on.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
J and L jump back and forward ten seconds.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The digits 0 to 9 jump to a tenth of the video.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
While paused, comma and period step one frame.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Less than and greater than change the speed.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
F opens full screen. Escape closes it.
